{"id":"ea05aad1ea82db31","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-filter7-round-filter.md","title":"ZFC Filter7 Round Filter","display":"df-zfc-filter7-round-filter — ZFC Filter7 Round Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter7-round-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter7-round-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter7-round-filter — ZFC Filter7 Round Filter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter7-round-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-round-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter7-round-filter — ZFC Filter7 Round Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set\">58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(R\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (roundness relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> (filter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\\)</span> (proper set-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set\">58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RoundFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RoundFilter}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}round\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RoundFilter}_S(P,R,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(P,\\mathcal F)\\land R\\subseteq P\\times P\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists f\\in F\\;(\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}round\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RoundFilter}_S(P,R,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(P,\\mathcal F)\\land R\\subseteq P\\times P\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists f\\in F\\;(\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical set-filter predicate supplies the proper-filter clauses; the former dependency instead defined forcing filters on ordered posets and was the wrong abstraction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S$ (proper set-filter predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RoundFilter}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}round\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7RoundFilter}_S(P,R,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(P,\\mathcal F)\\land R\\subseteq P\\times P\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists G\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall g\\in G\\;\\exists f\\in F\\;(\\langle g,f\\rangle\\in R)","display":true}],"bytes":1162,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1923","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-filter7-round-filter.md|58-df-zfc-filter7-round-filter]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","6226ed6b29249a1a"]}